<item><title>Mauritius inflation climbs to 6.4% in October</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-inflation-climbs-to-6-4-in-october-34957a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-inflation-climbs-to-6-4-in-october-34957a/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>Annual inflation in Mauritius accelerated to 6.4% in October 2026, up from 5.7% in September, driven by fuel price adjustments.</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 08:31:46 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-inflation-climbs-to-6-4-in-october-34957a/share.jpg" length="37654" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-inflation-climbs-to-6-4-in-october-34957a/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
